  "findings": [
    "Task dispatch deduplication, not image/file equality; no production code adoption.",
    "Ownership-checked Redis Lua release and refresh are useful reference patterns. Full SHA256 is truncated to 16 hex characters (64 bits); not a proof of byte equality.",
    "pre_execute starts a heartbeat but does not acquire/reject a lock. After TTL expiry or lost ownership, heartbeat logs and stops; task execution is not fenced by this middleware. Static observation, not live Redis reproduction.",
    "Partial-key mode excludes positional arguments and absent requested kwargs, with warnings; explicit keys intentionally bypass task-name fingerprinting.",
    "parse_int_label accepts zero/negative and bool via int conversion; parse_list_label checks list container but not string element types. Source observations only.",
    "real_redis fixture flushes localhost database 15 before/after integration tests; not executed. No Redis server, HTTP, broker, or external state mutated."
